ew - Vinyl Wrap Toronto", "tag": ""}], "eid": "4c9998b"}], "padding": "0px 0px 20px 0px", "maxWidth": null, "background": "#FFFFFF"}, {"id": "b45e69d", "blocks": [{"type": "columns", "cols": [{"width": 50, "blocks": [{"type": "text", "html": "<h4>Avery Dennison Car Lettering by Vinyl Wrap Toronto</h4> <p>Using only professional material, we used Avery Dennison Supreme Wrapping Film to add car lettering to this Toyota Advertising Car. The vinyl we use here at Vinyl Wrap Toronto is guaranteed to last for 5 years by the manufacturers.</p> <p>We do both commercial and personal vehicles. Got a fleet to wrap? Want to have a custom design on your vehicle so that you stand out from the crowd while you are driving? We can add vinyl stickers or decal to any vehicle. Check out our Equipment <a href=\"/object-and-equipment-wrap-toronto/\">Page here</a> for more ideas.</p> <p>We got professional installers who have combined 20 years of experience and who can do an amazing job for you. Speak to our in-house design team about putting your ideas down on vinyl.<br/>If you like what we do and wants to get more update for our latest work, follow our social media, like for support and leave some comments so that we know what you are thinking about our wraps!</p> <p>Facebook Page: <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/vinylwraptoronto\">https://www.facebook.com/vinylwraptoronto</a></p> <p>Instagram Page: <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/vinylwraptoronto\">https://www.instagram.com/vinylwraptoronto</a></p> <p>Want to get the design that you always wanted on your car? Or wrap your vehicle for commercial use?<br/>We do business printing, Print3.net, and corporate apparel, <a href=\"https://workweartoronto.com/\">Workwear Toronto</a>, as well.<br/>Give us a call today at <a href=\"tel:416-746-1381\">416-746-1381</a> or visit our website: <a href=\"/\">https://www.vinylwraptoronto.com</a></p> <p><a href=\"https://g.page/vinylwraptoronto?share\">Click Here</a> to get directions to our garage.